            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Did Cabot\u2019s (CBT) Reinforcement Materials Leadership Change Just Shift Its Investment Narrative?",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Cabot Corporation announced that William (Bill) Masterson has been appointed senior vice president and president of its Reinforcement Materials segment, effective November 21, 2025, following the immediate departure of Matthew Wood. Masterson brings over a decade of multifaceted global leadership experience within Cabot, equipping him to lead one of the company\u2019s most critical business segments. We\u2019ll explore how Cabot\u2019s leadership transition in the Reinforcement Materials segment may shape...",
